# w.lang.en/shards/numbers: the number words the act reader needs before the catalog is reachable (ordinals of a list, small cardinals). The whole system of number words (twenty-one, dozen, half, thirds) is k.values.number (the number reader
# src/knowledge/values.mjs reads it): these lines are the seed and must agree with it. `last` is the one ordinal that counts from the end (value -1).
# sources: PSys2 worlds/acts (hand-written); k.values.number for everything else
# license: CC0-1.0

